<title>MEXICO: March foreign investment in Mexican securities up.</title>
<headline>March foreign investment in Mexican securities up.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign investment in Mexican securities rose 0.17 percent to $37.723 billion on March 31 from $37.657 billion on February 28, the Mexican Stock Exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said foreign investment in stocks fell 1.44 percent to $34.147 billion, while in the money market it rose 18.73 percent to $3.576 billion.  </p>
